					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13008173#post-4488329</guid>
				<title>An Easy Breezy Partnership</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13008173/the-powers-that-bark#post-4488329</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 03 Feb 2020 15:02:44 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>A Random Day</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1841781</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I've wanted to write a tale about Tau-5 getting a dog for almost three years now. As usual, TyGently came in and helped turn my ideas into actual writing. Benjy would not exist without them, nor would most of Onru's character moments. Plus it's really fun to work with them!</p> <p>Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1238719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581900301" alt="ch00bakka" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1238719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" >ch00bakka</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedantique" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3118444&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581900301" alt="Pedantique" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3118444)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedantique" >Pedantique</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vezaz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1403034&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581900301" alt="Vezaz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1403034)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vezaz" >Vezaz</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=560062&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581900301" alt="minmin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=560062)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" >minmin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tawny0" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2244665&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581900301" alt="tawny0" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2244665)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tawny0" >tawny0</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1814684&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581900301" alt="GreenWolf" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1814684)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" >GreenWolf</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1613974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581900301" alt="UraniumEmpire" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1613974)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" >UraniumEmpire</a></span> for their critique and feedback!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13008173#post-4488328</guid>
				<title>Authors Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13008173/the-powers-that-bark#post-4488328</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 03 Feb 2020 15:01:32 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>TyGently</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2038009</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Young and dumb and empty as shit<br /> Muscle and thumb and fingertips<br /> The desert sea is relentless<br /> Dead red blanket on a baby with a fever<br /> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Imy38sfUU4A">Once you see death naked, you just can't leave her</a></p> </blockquote> <p>Another collab from the Third Law power duo. After <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/death-perception">Death Perception</a> turned out so well, we decided to come together once again for a loose sequel!</p> <p>Also thanks to a friend of mine, whose experiment of a machine learning text generator trained on my articles ended up, by complete happenstance, creating the idea of a dog with extendo-legs. In that machine-generated text, the dog could also grow a goatee. This detail did not make it into the final tale.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
